<title>SPAIN: Metrovacesa to pay 55 ptas gross dividend.</title>
<headline>Metrovacesa to pay 55 ptas gross dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish property firm Metrovacesa said on Monday it is to pay a first interim dividend of 55 pesetas gross per share against 1996 results, effective January 3 1997.</p>
<p>In a note, the firm said this is the equivalent of 41.25 pesetas net, and represents a 3.77 percent increase over the previous year's gross interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
